---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { film, identity } from "../data/site";
---

<Layout
  context="about"
  title="Dylan Shade"
  description="Dylan Shade builds technology for a God-centered future — tools that empower purposeful living, not addiction. Software engineer and composer in Louisville."
>
  <!--
    TODO(dylan): a portrait is optional on this page. public/images/headshot.jpg
    is already in the repo if you want it in the margin later.
  -->
  <h1>
    Dylan Shade builds technology for a God-centered future — tools that empower purposeful living, not addiction.
  </h1>
  <p>
    I’m a software engineer and composer in Louisville. I want the things I make to help someone live on purpose: a chord under the fingers, a passage of scripture you can actually find, software that does not ask for your attention back.
  </p>
  <p>
    I currently work as an applied AI engineer at Papa Johns. Before that I was a software engineer at Forward Research and at JPMorgan Chase, where the work included an AWS migration, LLM-powered systems, and two hackathon championships. Earlier on I interned at Stantec, CSI, and OpenText.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href={identity.links.canon}>Canon</a> is the chord composer I keep shipping, for iOS, Mac, and Windows. With Chord Solver, Vivace Theory, and the other apps, that work has reached more than 25,000 people. I studied computer science at the University of Kentucky, with a minor in music, and I’m an AWS Cloud Practitioner.
  </p>
  <p>
    The other half is the <a href="/music/">music</a>: albums and singles, eight published choral and orchestral works, and sound for the film <a href={film.imdb}>{film.title}</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href={`mailto:${identity.email}`}>{identity.email}</a>
  </p>
</Layout>
